WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.690
Dad, what did you want to talk about?

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.210
Well, you see, Kotoko...

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:10.000
It’s already been a year since the Iries took us under their care.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.450
I’ve been thinking...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:19.030
...we can’t take advantage of Iri-chan and his wife’s kindness forever.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.950
So, what do you think?

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.790
Don’t you think it’s time to go back to living alone with your Dad?

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.310
Dad?

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.190
Iri-chan, Mrs. Irie...

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:11.820
Our new home is only a small apartment.

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:13.570
But it’ll be closer to our store.

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.190
Please visit us if you’re ever in the area.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.700
Hey, Kotoko.

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.780
Thanks for everything you’ve done for us.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.830
My time with the Irie family has been full of nothing but joy.

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:28.730
Kotoko-chan! I...

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:29.540
Oba-sama...

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.540
I can’t imagine a life without you!

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:36.550
Mama, you’re making it harder on Kotoko-chan.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.550
But...

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.290
Goodbye then, Iri-chan. We’re indebted.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:46.560
Please don’t say that.
Please come visit again, Ai-chan!

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:49.310
Irie-kun.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.300
Take care, okay?

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.670
Excuse me, but shouldn’t we get going now?

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:55.660
Right!

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:57.630
Well then, everyone, we’ll be leaving.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.030
Come on, Kotoko.

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:02.140
Goodbye.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.700
We’ll see you at Nishiogi then.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.630
Kotoko, time to go.

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:21.740
Kotoko-chan...

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:26.930
Finally, some peace and quiet around here.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.170
Why are you here?

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.770
You have your own room, don’t you?

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:34.630
Yeah. I just ended up here. Must be habit, I guess.

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:41.950
She really was an idiot, wasn’t she?

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.270
Yeah, she was.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.330
This new apartment will be
near my restaurant.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.830
It’ll be large enough since there’s only the two of us.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:57.610
But well, it is small if you compare it to Iri-chan’s place.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:45.890
I thought that it might be good for your health.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.370
It’s starting to rain.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.920
Sure looks like it.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.780
You left Irie’s house?!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.620
That sure is unexpected.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:59.480
Yeah.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.880
I was sure that you would have stayed behind.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.780
What’s wrong with you two?!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:08.290
We just moved to a place with an easier commute to my father’s shop!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:12.460
But, the only advantage you had was the fact that you two lived together, right?

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.580
Yeah, that’s true.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:17.290
Hey, it’s her.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.880
Her? Seriously?

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.120
I can’t believe it.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.650
Have I become the talk of the school?

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.570
You’ve long since been the type to be talked about.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.090
What the hell is going on?!

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:34.560
Kotoko, look at that!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.350
Okay, a katsudon, right?

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.390
Hey, bro, look up.

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:40.610
Please tell those who don’t know, okay?

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:41.840
Kin-chan!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.590
Oh, Kotoko, you’re here.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:47.110
What is the meaning of this? What if Irie-kun sees this?!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.780
He’s already seen it.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.660
So, the one who tired of the other wasn’t Irie-kun, right?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.660
Hey, you! Stop clinging all over Irie-kun!

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:02.850
But, you’re now dating that Kansai fellow over there, aren’t you?

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:04.780
Of course I’m not!

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:06.530
Really? You two look like a good couple.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:10.470
You make a good couple with Irie too, since both of you are ill-tempered.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.430
See, Irie-kun. He said we make a good couple.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.010
Ma’am, I’ll have Lunch A.

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:17.020
All right!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.730
Irie-kun, don’t you feel lonely?

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:25.490
No. It just feels like life has finally returned to normal.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.570
Of course it has.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.490
Yeah! You sure said it.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.880
I see. I guess so.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.860
What am I hoping for?

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:12.180
Gosh, how did I end up here?

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.220
Oh no.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.700
What was that sound?

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.780
Hello? Is anyone here?

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.340
Yuuki-kun!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:39.100
What’s wrong? Yuuki-kun!

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:40.550
My stomach...

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.120
Your stomach? Your stomach hurts?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.620
Where’s your mother?

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:55.600
She... went shopping...

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:57.380
It hurts!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:01.130
What should I do?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:09.820
From home?

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:13.000
Hello?

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.590
<i>Irie-kun!</i>

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.780
Kotoko! Why are you in my house?!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.220
<i>Hello? Irie-kun? Can you hear me?</i>

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:20.130
Honestly!

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:22.820
<i>Irie-kun, Yuuki-kun’s in big trouble!</i>

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:24.380
Yuuki? What happened?

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.750
He said his stomach hurts, and he suddenly threw up earlier.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.270
What should I do?

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.220
<i>Symptoms?</i>

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.420
What should I do?

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:35.070
<i>Calm down! Tell me properly.</i>

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:36.390
<i>What’s wrong with Yuuki?</i>

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:40.140
Okay. He said that his stomach hurts.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.030
<i>He’s thrown up twice since I got here.</i>

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:46.140
I see. It might be appendicitis.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.720
Write down what I’m going to say.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:55.960
First, turn him on his side so he doesn’t choke on his vomit.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.490
Yuuki-kun, hang in there.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:02.710
After that, call for an ambulance and have him taken to Sugimoto Hospital.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:06.120
It’s an emergency hospital. Our family doctor is there too.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.650
You got that?

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:15.790
I’ll head over there soon too.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:18.860
Okay.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.510
Kotoko, I’m counting on you.

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:37.480
It’s okay, Yuuki-kun.
We’re almost at the hospital.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:41.080
Irie-kun said that he’ll be going there soon too.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:42.830
Really?

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.580
So, it’ll be all right.

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.330
It’ll be all right.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.980
As I suspected, it’s ileocecal intussusception.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:09.680
How did the surgery go?

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:11.910
Don’t worry. It was a success.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:15.480
A section of his intestines got caught in-between a lower section of his bowels.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.360
It’ll return to its original position when he recovers.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.000
The wound will close up in a week.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.030
Really? Thank you so much.

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:32.460
Irie-kun. Where’s your mother?

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.550
She’s doing the paperwork to admit Yuuki.

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:36.260
It seems like the surgery was a success.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.720
Thank goodness.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.900
Ileocecal intussusception.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.950
It’s a kind of intestinal blockage, apparently.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.980
I didn’t know.

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.170
There’s nothing you can do about that.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:59.700
Honestly, I didn’t think it would be this scary not to know something.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:04.700
The doctor praised you for your quick response.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:06.740
That’s not true...

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.960
But, I wouldn’t have been able to do anything if I hadn’t asked you.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:12.130
I was all flustered.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:14.710
I’m going to call my Dad.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.670
I’m sure he must be worried.

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.120
Kotoko.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.310
I forgot my phone and my purse.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:25.590
Oh, man. I’m so absent-minded.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:35.410
Thank you, Kotoko.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:40.180
Irie-kun!

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:43.410
I was so scared!

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:44.860
It’s all right now.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:51.790
That was the first time Irie-kun said such kind words and held me in his arms.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:55.390
I cried until it felt like my eyes and heart were going to melt.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.430
Good afternoon!

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:06.640
Oh, Kotoko-chan. You’re here again today.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:10.210
You came again? You never miss a day, huh?

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:12.260
What are you saying?!

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:14.160
After all she’s done for you!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.930
It’s probably just because she wants to see Onii-chan.

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:18.250
That’s not true.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:20.910
But, Irie-kun isn’t here yet today?

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.870
See! Your true intentions are showing.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:24.620
He should be coming soon.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:29.620
You really should become my daughter!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.900
Having that type of talk again?

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.190
Irie-kun!

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:38.160
But, you’re happy to be able to see Kotoko-chan as well, aren’t you?

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.480
Thank you, Kotoko.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:43.760
Irie-kun...

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.350
I love you.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:50.410
Oh, my!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:56.230
I told you to not talk about other people’s love affairs and futures out loud.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.600
It’ll never work with Kotoko.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:13:59.430
Yuuki!

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:00.790
It’s impossible.

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:01.990
What’s with you?

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.660
Take a close look at your own
face in the mirror.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.030
What’s that supposed to mean?!

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:14.370
You’re such a brat!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:19.450
Sorry about that, Non-chan. We were getting too noisy.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:21.040
Nah, it’s okay.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.090
I’ve been admitted a long time, so this is real fun for me.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.840
Admitted for a long time?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.610
Yeah. I think it’s been around six months.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:33.100
So, it looks like I’ll have to repeat 4th grade.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:40.460
I got it! I’ll help tutor you, Mon-chan!

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.110
Umm, my name is...

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.950
It’s Non-chan, you dummy!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:47.940
It’s impossible for you to tutor anyone.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.520
You think so?

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.220
Don’t even think about it.

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.910
It’ll be okay.
He’s in elementary school, right?

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:56.960
This is nuts.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.660
What’s the big idea?

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:04.120
Don’t worry! I’ll boldly ram
into the ship for you!

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:06.510
Ram into the ship?

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.480
My! That sounds painful.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.190
It’s board the ship!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:16.820
Dummy!

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.310
Dummy!

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:27.240
Please keep it down!

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:28.690
This is a hospital!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.160
I’m sorry!

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:34.830
Oh my god! You people!

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:59.470
Boss, I’ve thrown out the trash.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.850
Oh, have you?

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.040
Is something the matter?

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:05.160
No. You can go home now.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:06.600
Okay, I’ll be going then.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.530
Seriously!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.130
Non-chan gets fevers easily.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.600
So, adults have to watch out for him.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:35.270
Yes, I’m sorry.

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:37.770
I’m sorry, Non-chan.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:41.270
Nah, I’m used to this.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:46.040
But, every day has been a lot of fun ever since Yuuki-kun was admitted.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:48.990
Onii-san has been tutoring me.

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:52.660
And, Kotoko-chan, you make me
laugh everyday.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:56.310
I’m not trying to make you laugh though...

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:59.230
I’ll help you with your studies once your fever subsides.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.840
I wonder what kind of illness Non-chan has...

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:08.040
I heard it was his kidneys.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:11.970
Really? He’s still so young.

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:17.130
Yet, everyday, he’s on drips, being examined, taking bitter medicines and such.

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:20.920
He can’t do the things that he likes.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:26.380
Your crying doesn’t help now, does it?

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.620
But!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.580
You’d definitely be able to do something, right?

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:39.350
Me? How?

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:42.530
Surely, you’re capable of becoming
a doctor, right?

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:48.790
That way, you’ll be able to help Non-chan and many others, and they’ll all be grateful to you!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.720
What do you think?

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:55.200
Me, becoming a doctor?

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.770
Yep! Don’t you think that sounds great?!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.060
I wouldn’t know.

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.410
You’d definitely make a great doctor!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:06.610
So, you’ve been going to
the hospital everyday?

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:10.210
And, you’ve been hanging out with Irie all this while, right?

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:16.240
Oba-sama has been very considerate, so we’re always together in the afternoons.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.750
Are you sure you don’t want his little brother to stay admitted a little longer?

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:21.740
Of course not!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.750
Because, health is everything, right?

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:26.700
She’s really acting like his big sister.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:31.370
Hey! And also, I’m tutoring Non-chan.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:32.510
Non-chan?

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:36.370
He’s the same age as Yuuki-kun, but he’s so adorable!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.860
Something to look forward to when he grows up.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.600
Are you ready?

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.330
Yuuki-kun, congratulations on your discharge.

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:52.450
Thanks.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:57.300
Yuuki-kun’s brother, Kotoko-chan.
Thank you for helping me with my studies.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:02.200
If there’s anything you don’t understand, don’t hesitate to call me.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.960
Non-chan, get well soon, okay?

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.200
Non-chan...

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.850
Don’t worry, Yuuki-kun.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:14.140
I want to get well soon too and go play at your house.

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:18.140
I’ll come here to play again.

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:20.510
Sure. See you then.

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:25.630
Non-chan sure is strong. He didn’t cry.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:30.860
Yeah. It’s always like that as his friends always get discharged first and he has to see them off.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.150
It must be so hard on him.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.520
Non-chan!

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:40.040
Non-chan!

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:46.030
See you again, Non-chan!

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:04.340
What is this about?

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:07.980
I felt like I was being selfish after all.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:09.340
Dad?

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:12.360
Saying this and that about having our own house...

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:18.440
After I saw you smiling at the hospital, I became certain that you were part of our family.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.620
Oba-sama...

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.930
What the heck is that?

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:23.450
What are you saying?

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:27.470
This time, you were saved by Kotoko-chan.

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:29.620
Then, what about my room?

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:33.830
Yes. It’s back to the way it was!

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.530
No way!

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:39.850
Actually, you should be thanking Kotoko-chan first, shouldn’t you?

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:41.950
Don’t worry about that.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.770
It was the natural thing to do.

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:54.430
Eh? Yuuki-kun, you’re not sleeping yet?

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:58.520
You really were a great help this time around.

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:00.650
Thank you.

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.910
That kid...

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:07.660
He does have an adorable side to him!

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.300
Irie-kun?

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.320
Ah, umm...

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:16.300
What is it?

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:21.390
No, nothing. Sorry, I came back here again.

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:23.680
Please...

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.830
...don’t cause too much trouble.

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:08.950
How romantic!

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:12.030
I can’t believe I’m spending spring break with Irie-kun at a pension.

00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:13.090
Irie-kun...

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:15.290
Matsumoto Yuuko! Why are you here?

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:18.330
It’s because my villa is really close by.

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.330
I didn’t hear about that!

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:22.180
Sheesh, you’re so loud no matter where you are.

00:23:22.180 --> 00:23:23.210
Right, Onii-chan?

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.170
Gasp! Onee-chan...

00:23:26.850 --> 00:23:28.880
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:30.720
Kiss, Kiss, Kiss in Dreams.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:32.430
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
